---
/**
 * Persistent demo-status banner (PROJECT_BRIEF.md Section 4).
 *
 * Rendered above the header on every page via BaseLayout. Deliberately not
 * dismissible: the honesty requirement is that the demo status is visible
 * everywhere, always, not just until someone clicks an X.
 */
---
<div class="bg-ebonised px-4 py-2 text-center">
  <p class="font-display text-sm text-linen">
    Demonstration project. North East Joinery is not a real business; this site
    was built by
    <a
      href="https://teessidedigital.uk"
      class="underline decoration-brass decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-brass-hover"
      >Teesside Digital</a
    >
    to show design and build quality.
  </p>
</div>
